# The HTTP form of a proto contract: the HTTP variation point attached to a
# service that already has the gRPC one, serving the same contract over HTTP.
# Besides the HTTP form, the example adds AddItem and ListItems over the list
# aggregate (ItemList, its items the children) and the repository's contract
# of Shared, kept in memory (src/Infrastructure/Memory), so it shows a path
# parameter, 201, 404, 409, and a deprecated method; those commands are why the
# gRPC endpoint, its scenarios, the module's projects, and its registration
# (TodoModule.cs) change. The item gets the store's key (Item.cs), and Shared
# the package of the specifications (Shared.csproj).
base library/architecture/dotnet/vp-grpc-api-in-dotnet.skill/examples
examples examples-proto
change src/App/App.Host/Program.cs
change src/App/App.Host/App.Host.csproj
change Directory.Packages.props
change Todo.slnx
change Makefile
change README.md
change .gitignore
change docs/integration/api/todo/todo.proto
change src/App/App.Host/Api/Grpc/Endpoint/ItemsHandler.cs
change src/App/App.Host.Tests/features/Grpc/items.feature
change src/App/App.Host.Tests/Steps/Grpc/ItemsServiceSteps.cs
change src/Modules/Todo/Todo.Application/Todo.Application.csproj
change src/Modules/Todo/Todo.Application.Tests/Todo.Application.Tests.csproj
change src/Modules/Todo/Todo.Domain/Todo.Domain.csproj
change src/Modules/Todo/Todo.Domain/Entities/Item.cs
change src/Shared/Shared.csproj
change src/Modules/Todo/Todo.Application/TodoModule.cs
change src/Modules/Todo/Todo.Domain/Errors/TodoErrors.cs
